# wlink directives for THP.EXE, the TOOLHELP.DLL probe (tests/toolhelp/
# thp.c): every segment PRELOAD, so that Windows 3.1, which loads
# segments on demand, has them all in memory as w16 does
@tests/apps/app.lnk
option stack=16k
segment type code preload moveable
segment type data preload moveable
option packcode=0
